Package: mk-viral-assembly-webtool
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Jean Nascimento <nascimento-jean@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, ca-certificates, tar, zenity, util-linux
Homepage: https://github.com/nascimento-jean/MK-Viral-Assembly
Description: Graphical local interface for MK-Viral-Assembly
 Installs a native application window for the MK-Viral-Assembly Nextflow pipeline.
 On first launch it creates isolated Conda environments in the user's home
 directory. FASTQ files, databases and results remain on the local computer.
